o e pegou fogo às minhas mãos.","e":"He lit the match and set fire to my hands.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.832275,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"de1272d07cf640b4b209240a28be5e44","i":"022b83e835d9e88ba3c52c3c91c4dffc","r":"4648928:6616049:447:2842308","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4648928","6616049","447"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Assim que ele acendeu o fósforo, a bomba explodiu.","e":"No sooner had he struck the match than the bomb exploded.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.640271,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"2c2f52297db291e8ff4b2a99aaf62a97","i":"2a4f80115027dd9fc21cf6ec118c18e6","r":"937297:283295","c":"une_monica","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/937297","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/937297","b":"Tatoeba sentence #937297 by une_monica; English translation #283295 by CM","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/937297","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Então, pode muito bem ter riscado o fósforo.","e":"Then you may as well have struck the match.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.632242,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"9baf2c5d001472e4591c976f5d75f1cf","i":"3ef372297804ed60a6213f694b575ea4","r":"4089752:6674382:394:885265","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4089752","6674382","394"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Acendi meu último fósforo, esperando encontrar a porta.","e":"I lit my last match, hoping that I could find the door.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.755475,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"76d66538fd0bceafb309bdccbb18c023","i":"45c9adf31364f19db28b64a9285e6f77","r":"8301229:8257616","c":"JGEN","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8301229","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8301229","b":"Tatoeba sentence #8301229 by JGEN; English translation #8257616 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8301229","tu